                        caption: "Now playing on a phone or a tablet, top to bottom: the close button, the cover as wide as the page, which opens the album, the title with the part that plays, the album, one chip per artist, the position and the controls; the signal path, whose steps open from its light, the sound device, named beside its button, with the long list of an ALSA host under the Long text switch, and the sound processing; the lyrics, the heart and the menu; the queue. The lyrics, or the note in their place. A station has only play. Then the queue's rows, the one playing on a tinted row with a bar, and play or pause on its cover, the song played before above it; a work queued whole is one row that opens to its movements";
